### vercel.json

Configure the project so:

- The Express application is correctly routed.
- API routes work.
- Public routes work.
- Dashboard routes work.
- Static assets are served correctly.
- Client-side navigation does not produce unexpected 404 errors.

Use a Vercel-compatible configuration rather than relying on a traditional always-running Express server.

